_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bug Report\r\n\r\n## Original behavior in Nestjs 6\r\nIn Nestjs 6, it was possible to set all GRPC options, e.g. grpc.ssl_target_name_override and grpc.default_authority which are required to have GRPC-SSL enabled on localhost:\r\n\r\n```\r\nconst grpcOptionsAny: any = grpcClientOptions.options;\r\ngrpcOptionsAny['grpc.ssl_target_name_override'] = 'localhost';\r\ngrpcOptionsAny['grpc.default_authority'] = 'localhost';\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Breaking change\r\nThe commit 0b38029830f59d8a0092137c39ea4b30aa1377cb changed this behavior by removing `...this.options` from the used option-Object:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/nestjs/nest/commit/0b38029830f59d8a0092137c39ea4b30aa1377cb#r38494866\r\n\r\nNow, most of the GRPC-options are unavailable when using Nestjs:\r\nhttps://grpc.github.io/grpc/core/group__grpc__arg__keys.html\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"kamilmysliwiec","id":23244943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjQ0OTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23244943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamilmysliwiec","html_url":"https://github.com/kamilmysliwiec","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamilmysliwiec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamilmysliwiec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamilmysliwiec/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamilmysliwiec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamilmysliwiec/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamilmysliwiec/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamilmysliwiec/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamilmysliwiec/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kamilmysliwiec/received_events","type":"User","u